   "mechanism": "The Los Angeles trial moved blood-pressure care out of the clinic into a place men already visit often and trust. The system-wide protocol result (Kaiser Permanente) shows a single drug plan with a registry gets most patients controlled. Joined, the shop supplies reach and trust and the protocol supplies a care pathway cheap enough for a low-income health system.",
